<http://data.silknow.org/object/00624739-4417-30fd-8b62-394f0ac23136/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Woven silk dress fabric with a dark blue satin ground. Pattern in silvery white silk. Large repeating patterns of stylised flowers, leaves and stems. Two horizontal repeats, one with 2 motifs each having large flowers, buds and leaves, and between them and at each side there are scrolling stems and leaves.\n\nThe second row has a complete motif in the centre with rose-like flowers contained within a swirling leaf and stem design. Parts of this design are repeated at the left and right side. In between there are meandering stems and leaves.\n\nBoth selvedges are intact and attached at the right side is a tag with the number '39083'."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/00624739-4417-30fd-8b62-394f0ac23136> .

